Manifest-Version: 1.0
Bundle-ActivationPolicy: lazy
Bundle-Activator: org.apache.logging.log4j.util.Activator
Bundle-Description: The logging API of the Log4j project.     Library 
 and application code can log through this API.     It contains a simp
 le built-in implementation (`SimpleLogger`) for trivial use cases.   
   Production applications are recommended to use Log4j API in combina
 tion with a fully-fledged implementation, such as Log4j Core.
